      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Let's book a chest X-ray to look into chronic cough. Let's use pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast, for four weeks. You take it by mouth. That should help with reflux. Don't eat for two or three hours before lying down, and raise the head of the bed a little. Book a review in four weeks. Call the clinic if you need us.",
